          "maxStreams": 65535,
          "required": false,
          "description": "One OMM per object excluded because SGP4 cannot propagate it over the screening window (for example a decayed element set): its mean elements, with COMMENT giving the first failing epoch and the propagator error. Sent with the final result chunk; the statistics' TOTAL_OBJECTS leaves these out and OBJECTS_PARSED keeps them."
